#chip 10F200, 4

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): GATE FIX-shaped (large Wait, nop, If) loop on 10F200
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 20,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit
Dim Flag As Bit
Dim Cnt As Byte
Dim X As Byte
Dim Y As Byte
Dim W1 As Word
Dim W2 As Word
Repeat For 20 ms
    Wait 1009 us
    If Flag = 1 Then
        X = X + 1
        Flag = 0
    End If
End Repeat
Do
Loop
